benchmarks/ulr_vs_pulr -- the programs of Table 1 and Figure 5 (ULR-Baseline vs P-ULR)
======================================================================================

2,856 programs: 1,557 C programs from SV-COMP 2025 and TermCOMP 2025 (TPDB), and 1,299 Boogie programs
from the Ultimate repository (the paper's Section 6). They are those
with at least one lasso trace that ULR-Baseline proved terminating or non-terminating in the paper's
run (logs/ULR_vs_PULR_logs.zip). The other programs of the original benchmark are in
benchmarks/additional_programs.
